@startuml activity-offline-capture
!include style.iuml
title Saving patients and screenings with or without internet (activity, FR-03)

|Clinician|
start
:Register or edit a patient, or record a screening
for one (registered on this phone, or downloaded
earlier): PSA, free PSA, DRE, PI-RADS, volume, notes;
|Phone app|
:Check the values (ranges, required fields);
:Save in the phone's encrypted database (SQLCipher)
and add an operation to the outbox,
with a new idempotency key;
:Show it as "Saved on device";
if (Online?) then (no)
  :Keep it on the phone;
  :Retry later (2 s, doubling, at most 15 min,
  with jitter), or at once with "Sync now";
  detach
endif
:Send the oldest operations in batches of 50
(POST /sync), marked "sending";
|Backend|
:For each operation, in order:
was this idempotency key seen before?;
if (Seen?) then (yes)
  :Return the stored result again
  (a retry never saves twice);
else (no)
  :Check the permission and the facility;
  if (Valid and allowed?) then (no)
    :REJECTED, with a reason;
  elseif (A patient edit based on an\nolder server version?) then (yes)
    :CONFLICT, with the server's copy;
  else
    :APPLIED: save in PostgreSQL,
    version + 1, audit event;
  endif
  :Store the result under the key;
endif
|Phone app|
switch (Result?)
case (APPLIED)
  :Remove from the outbox,
  show "Synced";
case (CONFLICT)
  :Keep both copies,
  show "Needs attention";
  :Clinician keeps the server's
  copy or their own;
case (REJECTED)
  :Show the reason,
  "Needs attention";
  :Clinician discards it;
endswitch
:Download changes for the facility
(GET /sync/changes, by cursor);
stop
@enduml
